/-!
# Finite rational circulant certificate for the AES inverse S-box

A rational certificate on the 255 nonzero byte differences, checked on one
cyclic row of its residual. `SboxCirculantPSD` lifts it to the whole
circulant matrix, `SboxCyclicIdentification` identifies it with the
inverse-byte difference counts, and `SboxNormTransfer` and
`SboxAffineBridge` carry the bound to the AES S-box.
-/

